{
    "title": "AMAZE!",
    "description": "This game will AMAZE you!\r\n\r\nLets pop & move the ball and paint - you\u2019ve got to color and paint your way across the AMAZE crossy road maze puzzles. Are you ready for extraordinary going balls in a paint puzzle adventure? Get ready to be amazed!\r\n\r\nTo fill in puzzles, fill each square to unlock more addictive AMAZE maze paint puzzles.\r\nWatch out! AMAZE gets harder as you play, color and paint the maze, and fill in crossy road puzzles!\r\nEach level is a canvas - paint with going balls!\r\nPainting the maze puzzles sounds easy, but you have to be super strategic to color maze runner and fill every square. \r\n\r\nMake sure you fill in puzzles as a maze runner COMPLETELY! If you don\u2019t fill it with going balls , even one square, you\u2019re stuck in the paint maze FOREVER!\r\n\r\nLet's pop this maze with color crossy road!\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\nMesmerizing Maze Runner Puzzles: Dive into a world of challenging puzzles that will test your strategic crossy road skills. Paint your way to victory by swiping the ball through the maze, filling each square with vibrant colors.\r\nArtistic Challenge: Become a true maze artist! To conquer each level with going balls, you must think ahead and plan your moves carefully. The puzzles start easy, but watch out\u2014each new maze brings a greater challenge.\r\nAddictive Gameplay: The thrill intensifies as you progress! Can you handle the escalating difficulty? Every completed maze unlocks new addictive challenges that will keep you hooked.\r\nEndless Exploration: With countless levels to conquer, AMAZE!!! offers endless entertainment. Explore new dimensions of painting puzzles, and discover the satisfaction of conquering even the trickiest mazes.\r\nCAUTION:\r\nMind the Gaps: Precision is key! Fill in each square strategically. Leave no gap unpainted, or risk being trapped in the paint maze forever.\r\nGet ready for an amazing journey of color, strategy, and endless fun. Can you paint your way to victory and conquer the maze? Play AMAZE!!! now and challenge yourself on the go!\r\n\r\n\r\nTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our Privacy Policy: https://crazylabs.com/privacy-policy/",
    "descriptionHTML": "This game will AMAZE you!<br><br>Lets pop &amp; move the ball and paint - you\u2019ve got to color and paint your way across the AMAZE crossy road maze puzzles. Are you ready for extraordinary going balls in a paint puzzle adventure? Get ready to be amazed!<br><br>To fill in puzzles, fill each square to unlock more addictive AMAZE maze paint puzzles.<br>Watch out! AMAZE gets harder as you play, color and paint the maze, and fill in crossy road puzzles!<br>Each level is a canvas - paint with going balls!<br>Painting the maze puzzles sounds easy, but you have to be super strategic to color maze runner and fill every square. <br><br>Make sure you fill in puzzles as a maze runner COMPLETELY! If you don\u2019t fill it with going balls , even one square, you\u2019re stuck in the paint maze FOREVER!<br><br>Let&#39;s pop this maze with color crossy road!<br>KEY FEATURES:<br>Mesmerizing Maze Runner Puzzles: Dive into a world of challenging puzzles that will test your strategic crossy road skills. Paint your way to victory by swiping the ball through the maze, filling each square with vibrant colors.<br>Artistic Challenge: Become a true maze artist! To conquer each level with going balls, you must think ahead and plan your moves carefully. The puzzles start easy, but watch out\u2014each new maze brings a greater challenge.<br>Addictive Gameplay: The thrill intensifies as you progress! Can you handle the escalating difficulty? Every completed maze unlocks new addictive challenges that will keep you hooked.<br>Endless Exploration: With countless levels to conquer, AMAZE!!! offers endless entertainment. Explore new dimensions of painting puzzles, and discover the satisfaction of conquering even the trickiest mazes.<br>CAUTION:<br>Mind the Gaps: Precision is key! Fill in each square strategically. Leave no gap unpainted, or risk being trapped in the paint maze forever.<br>Get ready for an amazing journey of color, strategy, and endless fun. Can you paint your way to victory and conquer the maze? Play AMAZE!!! now and challenge yourself on the go!<br><br><br>To opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our Privacy Policy: https://crazylabs.com/privacy-policy/",
